{"publicId":"3911c4dd-6541-4d19-9565-50a0196e36a1","title":"UC Davis团队完成玄武岩粉末碳封存田间试验","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T02:20:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T02:20:01.000Z","digest":"2026年11月17日，UC Davis研究团队在加州Sierra Foothill农业试验站公布两年期田间试验结果，证实玄武岩粉末施用使土壤有机碳含量提升约15%（数据来源：Phys.org最新报道）。该试验采用每英亩撒布2000磅玄武岩粉末的标准操作流程，样本覆盖三种主要土壤类型。早前报道（未标注具体日期）仅提及试验进行中，未披露量化结果。研究称玄武岩风化产生的硅酸盐矿物可长期稳定土壤碳（引用自Phys.org），但未提供长期监测数据。该成果为地质碳封存技术提供了田间验证案例，目前尚无同行评审论文公开。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T02:24:08.785Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"UC Davis研究团队公布玄武岩粉末加速碳封存田间试验结果","latestReport":{"id":"gncjcv6xbt90kujmak29xffxr"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f_Ma2c4lj57E","title":"UC Davis researchers study enhanced rock weathering for carb","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T02:20:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"gncjcv6xbt90kujmak29xffxr","title":"UC Davis研究团队公布玄武岩粉末加速碳封存田间试验结果","summary":"UC Davis研究团队在Sierra Foothill Research and Extension Center完成为期两年的田间试验，量化玄武岩粉末在土壤中加速碳封存的效果。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:20:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"gncjcv6xbt90kujmak29xffxr","title":"UC Davis研究团队公布玄武岩粉末加速碳封存田间试验结果","summary":"UC Davis研究团队在Sierra Foothill Research and Extension Center完成为期两年的田间试验，量化玄武岩粉末在土壤中加速碳封存的效果。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T02:20:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T08:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"part